:0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproductible in 4.6.0, 4.6.1-rc1, v4.7.dev.custom_build [56f3e2611] (latest commit at the time I am writting this issue)\n- Not reproductible in 4.5.1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9174) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-12900K (24 threads) - 63.78 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using the method [TreeItem.set_custom_draw_callback()](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.6/classes/class_treeitem.html#class-treeitem-method-set-custom-draw-callback) the drawn things are display below the \"selection box\" or the \"hover bow\" since version 4.6\n\nNote that ingame the selected is a little bit transparent so we can see behind but not ingame.\n\nIt's maybe a side effect of #114572\n\nMaybe we should draw using the RenderServer and the `content_ci` RID if we can access it somehow.\n\nCurrent result :\n<img width=\"1420\" height=\"552\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0e47e96a-c5dd-4a6e-8319-a073290c9c4b\" />\n\nExpected result :\n<img width=\"1199\" height=\"510\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c0bff1b1-ea64-411b-8440-fcd9de5cf331\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a tree with the following attached script:\n\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends Tree\n\nconst ICON = preload(\"uid://bov1efxly4x0s\") # Godot default project icon\n\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar root: TreeItem = create_item()\n\n\tfor color: Color in [Color.RED, Color.GREEN, Color.BLUE]:\n\t\tvar child: TreeItem = root.create_child()\n\t\tchild.set_metadata(0, color)\n\t\tchild.set_cell_mode(0, TreeItem.CELL_MODE_CUSTOM)\n\t\tchild.set_custom_draw_callback(0, _custom_draw)\n\nfunc _custom_draw(tree_item: TreeItem, rect: Rect2) -> void:\n\tvar icon_color: Color = tree_item.get_metadata(0)\n\tdraw_texture_rect(ICON, rect, true, icon_color)\n```\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp_tree_draw_2026-02-07_18-22-59.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25153782/mrp_tree_draw_2026-02-07_18-22-59.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116013/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116013/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}